    "title": "Lewiston Man Arrested After Crashing Into Lewiston Police Vehicle - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christine Moore ,\n1 days ago LEWISTON – In the early morning of April 26th around 1:15 a.m., a Lewiston Police patrol vehicle was involved in a crash in downtown Lewiston. The patrol vehicle was driven by a 30-year-old female officer and was traveling westbound on D Street and was being followed by a 2009 Cadillac Escalade driven by 29-year-old Tristyn Weeks of Lewiston. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
